        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 41956eaf-82da-46c4-ae02-0953c3df5a58).Image",
        "Description": "It&apos;s a somber day 47,\rToday we have been contracted to locate and eliminate an american agent undercover as someone six feet under. I believe you&apos;ve been briefed on him before? Well all things must come to an hindend, and these boxers are on their final round. The members of the hospital who have facilitated his subvert excersion also need to be put on ice. It&apos;ll be funnier when you see where agent smith is. I&apos;ll leave you to prepare for this cold case.",
